(7524504, 1202804, 103032, '<td valign="top">There''s two photos in this challenge that I particularly like.  Yours is one of them.  I like the context and content of this photo; it tells me a story.  I like the motion/"action" of the ferry cutting through the water, in conjunction of the lull, waiting to get to the other side to continue one''s trip.  I like the "balance" of the photo that''s contingent with the lady that''s looking to the left of the frame.  My top pick.<br/> <br/>(Wonder if this is in the Seattle, WA area.  I know they have a lot of ferries in that area.)</td>', 'There''s two photos in this challenge that I particularly like.  Yours is one of them.  I like the context and content of this photo; it tells me a story.  I like the motion/"action" of the ferry cutting through the water, in conjunction of the lull, waiting to get to the other side to continue one''s trip.  I like the "balance" of the photo that''s contingent with the lady that''s looking to the left of the frame.  My top pick. (Wonder if this is in the Seattle, WA area.  I know they have a lot of ferries in that area.)', '2017-07-20 18:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524507, 1202487, 103032, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of this challenge.  I rarely read the titles, but yeah, lets go fishing.</td>', 'One of my favorites of this challenge.  I rarely read the titles, but yeah, lets go fishing.', '2017-07-20 18:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524508, 1202509, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the impression this gives of a full harbor/bay.  It reminds me of how the river in my city is socked full of pleasure crafts during the summer music festival at a river front park.  An 8 for the impression it gives me.</td>', 'I like the impression this gives of a full harbor/bay.  It reminds me of how the river in my city is socked full of pleasure crafts during the summer music festival at a river front park.  An 8 for the impression it gives me.', '2017-07-20 18:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524509, 1202757, 103032, '<td valign="top">I really like this, with the drama of the clouds and the rays of light, and just the front of the kayak. However, it just seems a bit too dark overall.  Just an opinion though.</td>', 'I really like this, with the drama of the clouds and the rays of light, and just the front of the kayak. However, it just seems a bit too dark overall.  Just an opinion though.', '2017-07-20 18:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
