(7525360, 1202733, 114285, '<td valign="top">Now this is exactly what I was thinking when I thought about this challenge, seems a lot of others didn''t think like this too. I love the tilt, good choice.<br/> <br/>I''ll congratulate you on your ribbon now.</td>', 'Now this is exactly what I was thinking when I thought about this challenge, seems a lot of others didn''t think like this too. I love the tilt, good choice. I''ll congratulate you on your ribbon now.', '2017-07-25 09:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
