(7525411, 1202333, 147314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery. Just can''t see the flag, but I guess it''s Norway?</td>', 'Beautiful scenery. Just can''t see the flag, but I guess it''s Norway?', '2017-07-25 18:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
