(7525451, 1202512, 124815, '<td valign="top">Independently of the topic (embraced so beautifully anyway) this is an image of so much interest.<br/>The chatting little boats are becoming a game of bowling under a dark sky.<br/>I bump it to 10<br/> <br/>(reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=16148" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">insteps</a> in a wonderful way)</td>', 'Independently of the topic (embraced so beautifully anyway) this is an image of so much interest.The chatting little boats are becoming a game of bowling under a dark sky.I bump it to 10 (reminds me of  insteps in a wonderful way)', '2017-07-25 21:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
