(7525460, 1202533, 124815, '<td valign="top">I returned to this a few times. Reminded me of a movie made in the 60s I think, "Mondo Cane" - there is some acidity in this story and a feel of excessive hedonism<br/>(way too much sharpening in my view)<br/>bump</td>', 'I returned to this a few times. Reminded me of a movie made in the 60s I think, "Mondo Cane" - there is some acidity in this story and a feel of excessive hedonism(way too much sharpening in my view)bump', '2017-07-25 23:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
