(7525494, 1202333, 104230, '<td valign="top">Sometimes mucking, or messing, about in boats and keeping them running can be critical to a certain ways of life. Lovely image.  I love the "pop" of color from the red roofs and buildings and the orange inside one of the boats. Hope you are both having a wonderful time.</td>', 'Sometimes mucking, or messing, about in boats and keeping them running can be critical to a certain ways of life. Lovely image.  I love the "pop" of color from the red roofs and buildings and the orange inside one of the boats. Hope you are both having a wonderful time.', '2017-07-26 01:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
