(7525573, 1202733, 56492, '<td valign="top">As the challenge wasn''t just ''Boats'', I thought the ''mucking about with'' aspect might be important. The description of the challenge encouraged all types of water craft, so I went for it.</td>', 'As the challenge wasn''t just ''Boats'', I thought the ''mucking about with'' aspect might be important. The description of the challenge encouraged all types of water craft, so I went for it.', '2017-07-26 07:10:51.000000', NULL, 0),
