(7525609, 1202803, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed that anyone would say it''s too busy -- it''s the busy that makes this absolutely fascinating. Not sure about the noise -- but I''ve been getting hypersensitive about noise because of my 7D. But that seems a bit too distracting. But it''s a marvelous find and a marvelous catch. Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'I''m amazed that anyone would say it''s too busy -- it''s the busy that makes this absolutely fascinating. Not sure about the noise -- but I''ve been getting hypersensitive about noise because of my 7D. But that seems a bit too distracting. But it''s a marvelous find and a marvelous catch. Congrats on the HM!', '2017-07-26 11:41:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525629, 1202803, 104230, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m amazed that anyone would say it''s too busy -- it''s the busy that makes this absolutely fascinating. Not sure about the noise -- but I''ve been getting hypersensitive about noise because of my 7D. But that seems a bit too distracting. But it''s a marvelous find and a marvelous catch. Congrats on the HM! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment Wendy.  The "noise" is actually the moisture in the atmosphere!  It was still very foggy, having been extremely foggy all day, and it was finally starting to lift.  That may be less obvious perhaps as I lightened the foreground a bit.</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: I''m amazed that anyone would say it''s too busy -- it''s the busy that makes this absolutely fascinating. Not sure about the noise -- but I''ve been getting hypersensitive about noise because of my 7D. But that seems a bit too distracting. But it''s a marvelous find and a marvelous catch. Congrats on the HM!   Thanks for the comment Wendy.  The "noise" is actually the moisture in the atmosphere!  It was still very foggy, having been extremely foggy all day, and it was finally starting to lift.  That may be less obvious perhaps as I lightened the foreground a bit.', '2017-07-26 12:59:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525683, 1202803, 109227, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM!  The busy is what makes this stand out.</td>', 'Congrats on the HM!  The busy is what makes this stand out.', '2017-07-26 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525684, 1202801, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great composition; congrats on the HM.</td>', 'Great composition; congrats on the HM.', '2017-07-26 17:12:13.000000', NULL, 0),
