(7525712, 1202733, 42013, '<td valign="top">floats? check.<br/>Holds a person? check.<br/>Sinkable? check.<br/>Muckable? check.<br/> <br/>Nice action shot! I felt your tilt was too extreme for my tastes but still gave it a good score.</td>', 'floats? check.Holds a person? check.Sinkable? check.Muckable? check. Nice action shot! I felt your tilt was too extreme for my tastes but still gave it a good score.', '2017-07-27 01:57:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525726, 1202801, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon. Super!</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon. Super!', '2017-07-27 09:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525727, 1202783, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealng image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>Wow, that must have been some adrenaline rush! Excellent timing to capture the boat in that position it has real impact and makes the image unique. Its surprising what even the smallest speck of red has in an image its such a strong vibrant colour. Apart from the tremendous action there is also the scene itself which could only be in Iceland, you lucky people you, Im not really jealous am I! Anyway, congratulations Benedikt, a well deserved ribbon</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealng image that meets the challenge well. Wow, that must have been some adrenaline rush! Excellent timing to capture the boat in that position it has real impact and makes the image unique. Its surprising what even the smallest speck of red has in an image its such a strong vibrant colour. Apart from the tremendous action there is also the scene itself which could only be in Iceland, you lucky people you, Im not really jealous am I! Anyway, congratulations Benedikt, a well deserved ribbon', '2017-07-27 10:11:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525728, 1202784, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interestng image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>I like your high viewpoint and the diagonal you have chosen to shoot it from it makes for a more dynamic image. The wash indicates that the boat is travelling at some speed again helping the dynamic tension. There are a couple of things that let it down for me, 1, the vignetting in the corners and 2, it feels over-saturated. Its possible that these are the genuine colours but if that is the case I would have been tempted to apply a little desalt to make it look more natural. Thanks for your entry Manic.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interestng image that meets the challenge well. I like your high viewpoint and the diagonal you have chosen to shoot it from it makes for a more dynamic image. The wash indicates that the boat is travelling at some speed again helping the dynamic tension. There are a couple of things that let it down for me, 1, the vignetting in the corners and 2, it feels over-saturated. Its possible that these are the genuine colours but if that is the case I would have been tempted to apply a little desalt to make it look more natural. Thanks for your entry Manic.', '2017-07-27 10:19:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525729, 1202759, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwinick:</b></div><hr/><i> night shots hard to do, I would used the painting with light technique with your flash..<br/> <br/>  vote 5 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was painted with a flashlight.</td>', 'Originally posted by kiwinick: night shots hard to do, I would used the painting with light technique with your flash..   vote 5   It was painted with a flashlight.', '2017-07-27 10:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
